et lost and sometimes stubborn as they learn how to walk.\nBut you'll be able to save all the slippers.\n\nA new concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(2)1440_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "843670026323221", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_843670029656554_4170918606599011011_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UgrOEFM27CoQ7kNvwFqOZjM&_nc_oc=AdmrehOIxLDTP0TfY2DNd1PsfPl83wJd9BOS4l6lQb9xEcGXWV4VXtGVyCdiWl-3Oe8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv0ojNa7jFVjv94mS0ATIsKbAt5hgUAFw8ZvVXucJZUZA&oe=699C589F"}, {"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(\uc2dc\uc5482)2560_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "627571058261409", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036641_627571061594742_7128199620299863828_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l5Oa0FGSmeUQ7kNvwH8XBHU&_nc_oc=Adnw20nNsX6vyQxst-ukmMPyVQGYo5APfV1WCinnRKnDqRiZvolS-7yzhjCX6Fo9wos&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs4m7skgEV8l9AvxXd-72QaSZWRRJNGQIcXOQTAtsH8-A&oe=699C5487"}, {"file_name": "app_logo.png", "id": "583935226146634", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223477_583935232813300_935540870816570877_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FR5BcjD6QsYQ7kNvwE3ePmb&_nc_oc=Adnh6VDpEJ-ADbI4NHCbZ3rm8g-t7yD55z4reQlQ_WCuDyum_rg_c0cTK-3Xo47_k5I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsXTn5jBWbm9T1_rHY81En05-QFpFZCF2ECcAedbVwQZg&oe=699C58D7"}, {"file_name": "